# GTM V1.1 assessment exclusions — improvements #2, #3, #5, #6

**Owner routing (2026-06-27):** Assessment improvements **#5** (procurement objection rehearsal) and **#6** (ITSM pilot-readiness test) join **#2** (90-minute first-review dry-run cohort) and **#3** (principal architect dismissal cohort) on the **GTM V1.1 backlog**. They are **not** V1 assessment action items and **must not** resurface as deferred engineering batches, implementation prompts, or "still open" assessment gaps.

## Do not implement or re-prompt in assessments

When working from `docs/assessments/LATEST_GPT55.md`, assessment batches, or improvement lists:

- **Do not** add #2, #3, #5, or #6 to engineering implementation batches or §17 Tier 1–3 improvement opportunities.
- **Do not** suggest coding-agent work for these unless the user **explicitly** asks to pick up the matching GTM backlog row.
- **Do not** list them under "Still deferred (owner/customer input)" as items awaiting the next assessment pass — they are **GTM-tracked**, not assessment-tracked.

