## Scoring (unchanged)

- **`(A)` V1.1 headline readiness** must **not** be reduced solely for absent live cohort results, an unrun procurement rehearsal, or an incomplete ITSM pilot-readiness test.
- Discuss buyer friction under **`(B)` procurement realism** (zero weight on **`(A)`**) when relevant.
- See `.cursor/rules/Assessment-Scope-V1_1.mdc` when present.

## V1 vs GTM V1.1

- **V1:** shipped playbooks, trust center, ITSM outbound slice, objection drills, demo scripts — **in scope**.
- **GTM V1.1 (#2, #3, #5, #6):** human-led validation requiring live participants, pilots, or procurement reviewers — **pick up only when owner directs the matching GTM row**.
